+ * A34 (0977): Apple's vendor commands answered long enough. Boot 0976-120-a: 0976 worked (no 712, the switch stays
+ * on), but every 10-20 s bluetoothd aborted: PowerLog's session asked for the power profile, bluetoothd sent
